<%- include('partials/head') %>
<%- include('partials/header') %>
<article class="section print-sheet">
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">Programme overview</p>
    <h1 class="h2">Goforge Digital internship</h1>
    <p class="lede">A one-page summary for a student or a college training cell. The college decides whether this internship counts. This page does not promise that it will.</p>
    <p class="hero-actions no-print">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/internship/overview.pdf">Download PDF</a>
      <button class="btn btn-ghost" type="button" data-print>Print this page</button>
    </p>
    <h2 class="h3">How it runs</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Training: <%= s.intern_training %>, live online.</li>
      <li>Internship: <%= s.intern_work %>, supervised, after the training.</li>
      <li>Who can apply: BTech, BCA and similar courses.</li>
      <li>Fee: <%= s.intern_fee %>.</li>
      <li>Batch dates are confirmed on a call.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2 class="h3">If the work is finished</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Skills in the chosen role, and one project the student can explain.</li>
      <li>A training note.</li>
      <li>An internship letter naming Goforge Digital, the student, the college and course, the role, the exact dates, that the work was online, two or three lines on the work, and <%= BRAND.founder %>, <%= BRAND.founderRole %>, with a phone and email so the letter can be checked.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2 class="h3">What is not included</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>A certificate without the work.</li>
      <li>A job guarantee.</li>
      <li>A promise of college credit. Ask the training cell before paying. If they need hours or an NOC, say so on the call.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2 class="h3">Roles</h2>
    <% PROGRAMS.forEach(role => { %>
    <h3 class="h3"><%= role.name %></h3>
    <p><%= role.summary %> <% if (role.toolsList.length) { %>Tools usually include <%= role.toolsList.join(', ') %>.<% } %> <%= role.project || "" %></p>
    <% }) %>
    <p>Studio: <%= BRAND.address.line1 %>, <%= BRAND.address.line2 %>, <%= BRAND.address.region %>. <%= BRAND.website %></p>
  </div>
</article>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
